(2, 4, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 1 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 415 · Principles & Practice of Nephrology Nursing I', 'Concerning first use reaction in haemodialysis, choose the false statement', '["Its incidence is on the decline", "Dyspnea and vascular collapse are associated clinical findings", "It is related to biocompatibility of material in the extracorporeal circuit", "It usually occurs within the second hour of dialysis"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The correct answer is: It usually occurs within the second hour of dialysis.', 'NNP 415 · Principles & Practice of Nephrology Nursing I'),
