(2, 10, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 1 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 415 · Principles & Practice of Nephrology Nursing I', 'The following are sites for AV - Fistula creation except', '["Radio-sciatic", "Brachiocephalic", "Radiocephalic", "brachiobasilic"]'::jsonb, 0, 'The correct answer is: Radio-sciatic.', 'NNP 415 · Principles & Practice of Nephrology Nursing I'),
