(2, 76, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 1 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 416 · Nutrition and Dietetics in Nephrology Nursing', 'Which of the following mineral should be consumed in limited quantities by those undertaking Dialysis is', '["Mg", "Zn", "Fe", "K"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The correct answer is: K.', 'NNP 416 · Nutrition and Dietetics in Nephrology Nursing'),
