(2, 78, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 1 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 416 · Nutrition and Dietetics in Nephrology Nursing', 'Which self-monitoring task is most important for a CKD patient on a fluid-restricted diet?', '["Monitoring blood glucose levels", "Checking pupil reaction", "Measuring daily weights", "Tracking respiratory rate"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The correct answer is: Measuring daily weights.', 'NNP 416 · Nutrition and Dietetics in Nephrology Nursing'),
