(2, 93, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 1 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 416 · Nutrition and Dietetics in Nephrology Nursing', 'In ESRD patients undergoing dialysis, dietary protein intake is generally:', '["Maintained at a minimal level", "Restricted to plant-based sources only", "Increased to offset losses during dialysis", "Decreased to prevent hyperkalemia"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The correct answer is: Increased to offset losses during dialysis.', 'NNP 416 · Nutrition and Dietetics in Nephrology Nursing'),
