(1, 48, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Morning (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 421 · Medical-Surgical Nephrology II', 'This type of nephrotic syndrome occur as a result of disease specific to the kidneys.', '["membranous nephropathy", "minimal change nephropathy", "secondary nephrotic syndrome", "primary nephrotic syndrome"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The correct answer is: primary nephrotic syndrome.', 'NNP 421 · Medical-Surgical Nephrology II'),
