(1, 50, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Morning (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 421 · Medical-Surgical Nephrology II', 'This type of nephrotic syndrome occur as a renal manifestation of systemic general illness. i.e. the origin of the disease is not from the kidney itself, rather as a result of other systemic diseases.', '["tertiary nephrotic syndrome", "primary and secondary nephrotic syndrome", "primary nephrotic syndrome", "secondary nephrotic syndrome"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The correct answer is: secondary nephrotic syndrome.', 'NNP 421 · Medical-Surgical Nephrology II'),
