(1, 60, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Morning (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 421 · Medical-Surgical Nephrology II', 'Urinary tract infection mostly is common in female gender because of ??????', '["Microorganism differences", "Anatomical differences", "Microorganism", "Gender variation"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The correct answer is: Anatomical differences.', 'NNP 421 · Medical-Surgical Nephrology II'),
