(1, 65, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Morning (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 421 · Medical-Surgical Nephrology II', 'Condition in which there is blockage to the free flow of urine with resultant backflow and injury to one or both kidneys is called.', '["Renal disease", "Renal artery stenosis", "Renal stenosis", "Obstructive uropathy"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The correct answer is: Obstructive uropathy.', 'NNP 421 · Medical-Surgical Nephrology II'),
