(2, 13, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 422 · Gynaecology and Obstetrics in Nephrology', 'The type of female pelvis that can allow for a vaginal birth, but the labour might last longer is the:', '["Platypelloid pelvis", "Gynaecoid pelvis", "Anthropoid pelvis", "Android pelvis"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The correct answer is: Anthropoid pelvis.', 'NNP 422 · Gynaecology and Obstetrics in Nephrology'),
