(2, 18, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 422 · Gynaecology and Obstetrics in Nephrology', 'Which physiological change in normal pregnancy explains why a serum creatinine of 90 µmol/L (1.0 mg/dL) may be abnormal in the second trimester?', '["Increased GFR by 40-50%, lowering normal creatinine", "Decreased renal blood flow and GFR", "Decreased renal blood flow", "Reduced tubular secretion"]'::jsonb, 0, 'The correct answer is: Increased GFR by 40-50%, lowering normal creatinine.', 'NNP 422 · Gynaecology and Obstetrics in Nephrology'),
