(2, 74, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'Purpose of nursing audit include the following EXCEPT', '["Achieve desired and feasible quality of nursing care", "Find defaulter and punish them", "Stimulant to better records", "Evaluating nursing care given"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The correct answer is: Find defaulter and punish them.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 75, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'Which is NOT a subsystem in Johnson''s Behavioural System Model?', '["Dependency", "Spiritual", "Eliminative", "Achievement"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The correct answer is: Spiritual.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 76, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'With regards to EBP?????.. is an interactive model that depicts research as a dynamic process of interconnected decisions and actions taken by stakeholders?', '["Iowa model", "Ottawa model", "Stetler model", "ACE star model"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The correct answer is: Ottawa model.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 77, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'A nurse identifies a pattern of medication errors in administering phosphate binders to dialysis patients. What should the nurse do first?', '["Report the errors to the manager and stop medication administration", "Document the errors in the patient''s chart", "Educate patients about their medications", "Analyze the workflow and identify contributing factors"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The correct answer is: Analyze the workflow and identify contributing factors.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 78, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'One of these is a key concept in relation to global health', '["Infant mortality rate", "Lifestyle choices", "Global burden of disease", "Access to healthcare services"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The correct answer is: Global burden of disease.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 79, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'All of the following are the reasons for the concept of global health EXCEPT', '["Globalization", "Public health within a country", "Increasing internal and external immigration due to wars", "Global warming"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The correct answer is: Public health within a country.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 80, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'The judicious use of current best evidence in conjunction with clinical expertise and patient values to guide health care decisions is called', '["Evidence based medicine", "Evidence based nursing", "Quality assurance", "Evidence based practice"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The correct answer is: Evidence based practice.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
