(2, 82, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'In September 2000, the UN general assembly adopted the United Nations Millennium Declaration. Former UN secretary general Kofi Annan established 8 accompanying objectives to this declaration which was known as ______', '["Sustainable Development Goals", "War against Female Genital Mutilation (FGM)", "Millennium Development Goals", "Poverty alleviation programme"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The correct answer is: Millennium Development Goals.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 83, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'In the 1990s which form of disease burden is more predominant in the developing countries', '["Communicable disease", "Injuries", "Neuropsychiatric disorders", "Non communicable disease"]'::jsonb, 0, 'The correct answer is: Communicable disease.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 84, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'One of these following is a NOT an evidence base practice Model', '["ACE star model", "Stetler model", "Dance model", "Ottawa model"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The correct answer is: Dance model.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 85, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'The nephrology nursing staff conducts a quality improvement project to reduce infection rates associated with dialysis. Which strategy would be most effective?', '["Increasing the number of dialysis sessions per week", "Implementing strict aseptic technique during catheter care", "Reducing staff education on infection control", "Encouraging patients to self-manage their access site care"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The correct answer is: Implementing strict aseptic technique during catheter care.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
(2, 86, 'Nephrology Nursing Mock — Day 2 Afternoon (Nov 2026)', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues', 'The nurse is evaluating the impact of telemedicine on managing chronic kidney disease. Which outcome is a primary benefit observed?', '["Improved patient adherence to treatment plans", "Reduced access to specialists", "Decreased patient engagement in self-management", "Increased patient wait times for consultations"]'::jsonb, 0, 'The correct answer is: Improved patient adherence to treatment plans.', 'NNP 425 · Advanced Nursing Concepts & Contemporary Issues'),
